{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47294","headline":"览古十四首 七 · 吴筠","name":"览古十四首 七","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"鲁侯祈政术，尼父从弃捐。\n汉主思英才，贾生被排迁。\n始皇重韩子，及覩乃不全。\n武帝爱相如，既徵复忘贤。\n贵远世咸尔，贱今理共然。\n方知古来主，难以効当年。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吴筠","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_47294.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47294","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}